<U>PUBLIC TAKING</U>. In the event the leased premises or building is condemned or taken over by any city, state or federal authorities,
this lease shall be considered cancelled in its entirety and both parties relieved from further obligations.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

