<U>ASSIGNMENT</U>. This lease shall not be assigned in whole or in part, except to an affiliated entity of Lessee, nor said premises
sublet by the Lessee without first obtaining written consent of the Lessor, which shall not be unreasonably withheld.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

